  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom and Sam are at Grandpa's house. It is lunch. The table is in the kitchen. Grandpa has meat and mango for them. Grandpa has a guitar. \"Clean hands, please,\" says Grandpa. \"Let's sing a song!\" Grandpa plays the music. Pip sits next to Sam.",
      "\"Clean, clean, clean your hands!\" \"Open, close, open, close!\" \"Hands, hands, one, two, three!\" \"Go, go, go to the table!\" Tom and Sam sing with Grandpa. Tom has a song in his head. Sam has a big smile. They look at their hands. They clap their clean hands. Grandpa smiles. Pip jumps and looks at them. \"Good song, friends!\" he says.",
      "Now they go to the table. There are meatballs and mango. \"Do you like meat?\" asks Grandpa. \"Yes, I do!\" says Sam. Tom has a big yellow mango. Pip says, \"Woof!\" He has meatballs too. They eat and eat. They are good friends. It is a good lunch!"
    ],
    "summary": "Grandpa plays the guitar and sings a clean hands song. Tom and Sam sing it, then they go to the table for meatballs and mango.",
